  "description": "Labeled Timișoara facade test set for the M2 benchmark and the M4 offline demo cache. Districts: Cetate, Fabric, Iosefin.",
  "ground_truth_status": "DRAFT. `expected_style` is the team's labeling target. `expected_details` (bbox + raw_text) describe the SYNTHETIC CARD in `image` / `card_svg`, NOT a surveyed facade. Inscription texts on the cards are illustrative. When a real photo is added under `photo`, re-annotate its details against that photo. `metadata` facts are unverified until M3's knowledge base confirms them (`verified: true`).",
